              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 9:48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi baryahsohora baze kureeba emitumbi y'abangomeire; ahabw'okuba enyogori zaabo tizirifa, n'omuriro gwabo tiguriraazibwa, baryaba ekihagaro aha bantu boona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
